# Source: crattt-clean-2.ipynb, cells 9 and 12 (corrected)
# Not present in the original tiny-model Vast.ai sweep.
# Replaces post_process_grounded_object_detection, which
# silently drops detections on composite phrases like
# "chair couch". Uses per-category argmax over token spans.
